{"id":"n56062-2-7","stage":5,"title":"모질다 · 坚强","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56062-2-7-1","ko":"저 군인은 몇 번이나 죽음의 위기를 넘겼는지 몰라.","zh":"那个军人不知度过多少次生死关头了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"군인은","meaning":"军人","explanation":"군인：军人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"군인","audio":"/audio/8be042648e2b43520bd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62241","senseId":"1","lemma":"군인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"군인은","audio":"/audio/a2d12ba23f402a323639.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"번이나","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번이나","audio":"/audio/1d3bfcb847812c01a644.mp3"}},{"text":"죽음의","meaning":"死亡","explanation":"죽음：死亡；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"죽음","audio":"/audio/73f381e31e823f6e43a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62454","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죽음의","audio":"/audio/288226c211d5ef9912db.mp3"}},{"text":"위기를","meaning":"危机","explanation":"위기：危机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"위기","audio":"/audio/32baa3b7ac8479fc0d63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26727","senseId":"1","lemma":"위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위기를","audio":"/audio/d206f426660cccca1c37.mp3"}},{"text":"넘겼는지","meaning":"度过","explanation":"넘기다：度过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"넘기다","audio":"/audio/0d70fdb50ff913029a23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28562","senseId":"2","lemma":"넘기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘겼는지","audio":"/audio/02edf77e1841f06862f9.mp3"}},{"text":"몰라.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰라","audio":"/audio/8884d387268b95cb0579.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"8be042648e2b4352","term":"군인","zh":"军人","audio":"/audio/8be042648e2b43520bd1.mp3","entryId":"62241","definition":"隶属于军队并接受使用武器等的军事训练，承担一定任务的人。","pronunciation":["구닌"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"73f381e31e823f6e","term":"죽음","zh":"死亡","audio":"/audio/73f381e31e823f6e43a9.mp3","entryId":"62454","definition":"失去生命，或指其失去生命的状态。","pronunciation":["주금"]},{"id":"32baa3b7ac8479fc","term":"위기","zh":"危机","audio":"/audio/32baa3b7ac8479fc0d63.mp3","entryId":"26727","definition":"危险的关头；危险的瞬间。","pronunciation":["위기"]},{"id":"0d70fdb50ff91302","term":"넘기다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/0d70fdb50ff913029a23.mp3","entryId":"28562","definition":"经历困难并通过。","pronunciation":["넘기다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ee2276b6343ef612571.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56062-2-7-2","ko":"그래. 사람 목숨이 얼마나 모진 것이니?","zh":"是啊，人的生命力多顽强啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"목숨이","meaning":"命，生命，性命","explanation":"목숨：命，生命，性命；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목숨","audio":"/audio/3255b0b5500a0f947550.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16152","senseId":"1","lemma":"목숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목숨이","audio":"/audio/50021a4d7a1c0abb4def.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多么","explanation":"얼마나：多么。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"모진","meaning":"坚强，顽强","explanation":"모질다：坚强，顽强；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"모질다","audio":"/audio/3d9cd81a92248415c728.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56062","senseId":"2","lemma":"모질다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모진","audio":"/audio/de48dcbf5b84e5369045.mp3"}},{"text":"것이니?","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것이니","audio":"/audio/0b8a58c8385a8c547862.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"3255b0b5500a0f94","term":"목숨","zh":"命，生命，性命","audio":"/audio/3255b0b5500a0f947550.mp3","entryId":"16152","definition":"人或动物呼吸着生存的力量。","pronunciation":["목쑴"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"状态或感觉等的程度非常大而厉害地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"3d9cd81a92248415","term":"모질다","zh":"坚强，顽强","audio":"/audio/3d9cd81a92248415c728.mp3","entryId":"56062","definition":"拥有足能克服或忍受困难的坚韧的毅力。","pronunciation":["모ː질다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5a3dd2e752b59ce6c77.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.391,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56062","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2177,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，人的生命力多顽强啊。","昨天凌晨两点左右睡不着，就出去散步了。","那个军人不知度过多少次生死关头了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，人的生命力多顽强啊。","那个军人不知度过多少次生死关头了。","昨天凌晨两点左右睡不着，就出去散步了。"],"answer":0}]}
